cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the article."
title: "evoproto: reference implementation of an evolution-informed, evidence-gated engineering design framework"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-18"
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/omega2417/bnt"
url: "https://github.com/omega2417/bnt/tree/master/evoproto"
abstract: >-
  evoproto realizes the evolutionary-engineering knowledge graph, the
  phylogenetic signal and convergence measures, the analog retrieval score with
  transfer uncertainty, the constrained multi-objective search, the
  evidence-gated decision rule with abstention, and the three-arm experimental
  protocol of the accompanying article. The bundled pipeline runs in synthetic
  mode only; no biological records are distributed with the package.
keywords:
  - biomimetic design
  - evolutionary data
  - knowledge graph
  - generative design
  - multi-objective optimization
  - additive manufacturing
  - reproducible research
